    "detailed_description": "Having encountered a god, you must protect this world from demons.<br>Enter the demons' lair and wipe out the demons before they damage the world!<br><br>If you dodge the enemy's attacks, you can acquire orbs that can be used to craft weapons.<br>When two orbs are acquired, a weapon is created.<br>Depending on which orb you have acquired, the weapons you can use will vary.<br>You can use your weapon to damage enemies.<br>It is a boss rush game where you clear the game by defeating the bosses you encounter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D side view game</li><li>Boss rush</li><li>Avoid enemy attacks</li><li>Attack by combining marbles</li></ul>",
